# Distinct marketing sections

Consecutive sections on home and services pages must read as separate bands (alternating backgrounds, soft patterns, or dark CTA bands). Do not stack identical flat white sections.

## Allowed differentiation

- Alternating `bg-white` / `bg-zinc-50` / soft `bg-orange-50/60` with optional light dot pattern
- Dark CTA bands (`bg-[#111827]`) for closing CTAs
- Subtle `border-y border-border` between bands when helpful
- Card accents (orange left border, warm blurs) **inside** a section — not as a full-width orange rule under the hero

## Forbidden under heroes

- Do **not** add `h-1` orange gradient dividers on the section immediately below any hero
- First content section after a hero: clean edge only (no orange top bar)

## Keep

- Section `h2` at 36px / bold (see section-title-typography rule)
- Body copy at `text-base` (16px) unless an existing pattern requires otherwise
